{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.tritium_qvalue_symbolic","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.tritium_qvalue_symbolic","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.tritium_qvalue_symbolic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.tritium_qvalue_symbolic","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/tritium_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L61-L77","doc":"**Tritium `Q`-value closed form (derived).**\n\n`Q(³H → ³He) = m_e · 3(q²−1)³(q²+1)²(3q⁴+4q²+3) / (32q⁷)`.\n\nThe proof substitutes the channel-sum inputs `a, b` into the branching\nansatz `Q = a·b·(a − b)·m_e` and clears denominators — a genuine\nrational-function derivation, NOT a read-back of a stored conclusion. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:tritium-qvalue-symbolic","label":"prop:tritium-qvalue-symbolic","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/tritium-qvalue-symbolic.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext.qvalue_branching","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext.qvalue_branching","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/tritium_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L59-L59","doc":"Branching-factorisation ansatz: the `Q`-value equals the product of\nthe `4³` configuration sum `a·b·(a − b)` times `m_e`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext.b_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext.b_eq","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/tritium_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L56-L56","doc":"Channel-sum input: `b = −3(q²−1)(q²+1)² / (4q³)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext.a_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext.a_eq","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/tritium_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L54-L54","doc":"Channel-sum input: `a = −h/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext.b","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext.b","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/tritium_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L52-L52","doc":"Standard-channel sum `b` (categorical input). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext.a","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext.a","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/tritium_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L50-L50","doc":"Standard-channel sum `a` (categorical input). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext.Q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext.Q","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/tritium_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L48-