/QOU/ParticleInteractions/tritium_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Substrate parameter `q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/tritium_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.TritiumQvalueContext","kind":"class","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/tritium_qvalue_symbolic.lean#L34-L59","doc":"Context for the tritium `Q`-value: the substrate parameter, electron\nmass, and the two branching-factorisation channel sums `a`, `b` carried\nas their categorical-input *definitions* (not the conclusion — the\nrational closed form is derived from them in `tritium_qvalue_symbolic`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}